  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.8 (forks 2.3.13) - WebGPU: WebGPUAccelerator.PrecompileAsync builds kernel pipelines in the background and in parallel before their first launch (first launches compile one shader at a time with the queue waiting). CUDA: CudaAsm.Emit with several output operands, kept in registers. QR codes conform to ISO/IEC 18004 (format bits were transposed) and the decoder reads large, rotated and angled codes. See CHANGELOG.md.",
